## What findings do to the verdict

| Finding | Effect |
|---|---|
| CONFIRMED `BLOCKER` / `MAJOR` | {{blocking_verdict}} |
| PLAUSIBLE `BLOCKER` | {{plausible_blocker_effect}} until the named evidence is supplied |
| Other PLAUSIBLE | Question to the writer via {{question_channel}}; not blocking alone |
| `MINOR` | Listed; fixed in the same revision when cheap; not blocking alone |
| Same finding returned a third time | Escalate to {{escalation_role}} with both positions; nobody waives it |

## Roles

**{{reviewer_role}}** — runs `standard` (or `deep`) before the compliance checks; read-only toward application code and tests; writes findings only to the report.

**{{coder_role}}** — runs `quick` on their own diff after targeted checks pass and before handoff; fixes every CONFIRMED finding inside the approved scope **with the missing test**, reruns checks, lists open PLAUSIBLE findings in the handoff. A fix that changes behavior, API or design goes back to {{planning_gate}}.

